loose in the school?

343
00:13:23,978 --> 00:13:25,016
Darrin.

344
00:13:25,251 --> 00:13:26,907
Sorry.
I just love guessing.

345
00:13:27,014 --> 00:13:30,304
Gentlemen, we're going to
