from our diet,

370
00:14:23,455 --> 00:14:25,832
I might have found a way
to prevent cancer.

371
00:14:26,062 --> 00:14:26,923
Whew.

372
00:14:28,223 --> 00:14:29,452
Miss Heck?

373
00:14:29,579 --> 00:14:32,734
Um, well... my hypothesis...

374
00:14:32,865 --> 00:14:36,565
