375
00:14:36,703 --> 00:14:38,484
(Laughter)

376
00:14:38,752 --> 00:14:40,471
(Exhales deeply)
It's more than you think.

377
00:14:40,591 --> 00:14:42,935
You see,
the purpose of this project

378
00:14:43,066 --> 00:14:46,122
